flowchart TD
    A[Plain English proposal or resolved-review suggestion] --> B[Policy editor saves a draft]
    B --> C[Preview impact on current case revisions]
    C --> D{Same base version and current editor preview?}
    D -->|No| E[Reload the policy or repeat the preview]
    E --> B
    D -->|Yes, explicit publish| F[Append published policy version]
    F --> G{Current business action already succeeded?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Keep original decision and policy version]
    G -->|No| I[Set policy_pending and hold action]
    I --> J[Staff explicitly requests reassessment]
    J --> K[Evaluate all requirements under the new version]
    K --> L[Retain remaining blockers or allow simulation]
